character: marina
season: 1
episode: 2
title: The Revisit Hub
pov: fixer
luteVersion: "0.21.1"
# Root capability profile (project lute.project.yaml), with the SAME scene-local
# `plugins:` options episode01.lute narrows to: a project compiles to one capability
# snapshot (`compile --all`, `play`, `check-project` refuse two — E-CAPABILITY-MISMATCH),
